        "TileImage": "$($repository 6bc805b4-e7df-46f1-ad37-deb8b3967e08).Image",
        "Description": "Who&apos;s this subject? Agent 47?\r\rAs in, Burnwood&apos;s pervious weapon?\r\rFascinating.\r\rHe forgot a lot after that train incident, huh?\r\rOh? He&apos;s doing some sort of training?\r\rI see.\r\rHe&apos;s doing this &quot;challenge&quot; suit only? Really? Aren&apos;t disguises his thing?\r\rNo collateral either, huh? AND in an oddly specific time limit?\r\rIf he can master this, who knows what else he&apos;s capable of...\r\rIf this goes well, then I&apos;ll consider taking him under my wing. I&apos;ve got the money,  just let me know where to sign.",
